    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated in the popular Ravenswood area of Carrick-on-Suir, 29 Ravenswood is a two-storey, three-bedroom mid-terrace residence offering well-proportioned accommodation together with off-street parking to the front and a garden to the rear.\r\n\r\nThe property provides a practical layout suited to modern family living, with the accommodation extending to an entrance hall, sitting room and kitchen/dining room on the ground floor. The sitting room features a timber fireplace with metal inset, while the kitchen/dining room is fitted with kitchen units, tiled splashback, oven, hob and extractor. Double doors provide access from the kitchen/dining room to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nA guest WC is conveniently located off the entrance hall.\r\n\r\nAt first-floor level there are three bedrooms, including a main bedroom with en-suite shower room, together with a separate bathroom. The bedrooms are finished with fitted carpets, curtains and blinds, with the main bedroom also benefiting from its own en-suite facilities.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property has a front garden with off-street parking and a rear garden, providing useful outdoor space.\r\n\r\nWith its combination of practical accommodation, private outdoor space and convenient parking, 29 Ravenswood represents an appealing opportunity for those seeking a three-bedroom home in Carrick-on-Suir."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Off-street parking to the front\r\n\r\nRear garden with direct access from the kitchen/dining room\r\n\r\nWell-proportioned sitting room with timber fireplace and metal inset\r\n\r\nFitted kitchen with tiled splashback and integrated cooking appliances\r\n\r\nDouble doors opening from the kitchen/dining room to the rear garden\r\n\r\nMain bedroom with en-suite shower room\r\n\r\nThree bedrooms arranged over the first floor\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC off the entrance hall\r\n\r\nPractical two-storey layout"
      },
      {
